#ROOMS

#11000
"Woodland Path"
"The trees on either side to the west and east show definite signs of
depredation.  Someone has hacked some down leaving ragged stumps.  Other
trees, though currently still whole, have gouges in the side from preliminary
axe-blows.  A trail narrows to a small animal trail as it heads south but
quickly shows signs of widening as it moves northward.
"
"First room of orc lumber jack zone.  Ent newbie zone.
"
