#11002
"Woodland Path"
"You are on a wide forest path lined with the low ragged stumps of trees and
underbrush removed all around.  While the path itself runs north and south it
appears someone has begun the work of foraging a new path westward where
additional clear cutting of the forest has begun.  To the east a particularly
large shuvana tree shows a great deal of axe work has been placed into
bringing it down but its massive bole yet stands in spite of the countless
chips and gashes that mar its sides.
"
""
