#11003
"Woodland Path"
"Many of the trees still show signs of only initial depredations with only the
occasional chop mark in them where someone tested the heft of an axe or some
other blade.  A few thin stumps dot the ground showing where smaller trees and
underbrush have already started being cleared so work crews can begin on the
larger trees.  Off to the east, a regular path can be seen leading away north
and south.
"
""
301465608 0
3 6 0
D1
""
""
0 -1 11002 0 6
A
""
""
"room = find_room( 11003 );
mob = mob_in_room( 2828, room );
i = 0;
loop( all_in_room ) {
  if( num_mob( 2828, room ) )
    i++;
}
if( i == 1 )
send_to_room( #searching, room );
if( i == 2 )
  send_to_room( #hacking, room );
"
E
"searching"
"A scrawny goblin selects a tree that looks promising and takes a test swing at
it with its axe.
"
E
"hacking"
"The scrawny goblins take turns hacking at a particularly nice looking oak
tree, each swing digging a gouge into its fine bark.
"
!
