#11004
"Poorly Built Shack"
"The cheaply made walls of this shack almost look too haphazard to hold
together yet somehow they manage to remain standing displaying more strength
in effect than appearance.  A small table in the back of the shack is made
from hastily cut boards laid over two roughly even stumps still rooted in the
ground.  A doorway set in the western wall, slightly askew and without any
door in it, appears to be the only way in or out.
"
"command on plans to prevent taking needs fixing.
works if plans are on ground but can't check room number for mob.
"
301465604 0
0 5 0
D3
""
""
0 -1 11001 0 6
E
"2 tables 2 stumps 2 boards"
"The boards are rough-cut slabs nailed firmly down to two broad stumps.  The
boards show many knife gouges from someone repeatedly stabbing at them and a
few poorly carved letters that don't seem to spell anything in particulary.
The stumps the boards are nailed to are relatively even in height measuring
roughly a foot and a half off the floor.
"
A
""
""
"room = find_room( 11004 );
mob = mob_in_room( 2829, room );
if( mob ) {
  if( is_fighting( mob ) )
    end;
  if( has_obj( 4709, has_obj( 4710, room ) ) )
    send_to_room( #plans, room );
  else
    send_to_room( #noplans, room );
}
"
E
"plans"
"The scrawny goblin scout examines some plans sitting on the crudely made table.
"
E
"noplans"
"The scrawny goblin scout picks at a splinter on the table.
"
!
